		{"id":"blender_skills","type":"text","text":"# 🎨 Blender Agent Bundle\n**[[Blender Agent Skills & Blender-MCP]]**\n\n• **arjun988/blender-skills** (94+ procedural skills)\n• **Gorav22/Blender-mcp** (Live socket bridge)\n• Modeling, Retopo, Rigging, Geo Nodes\n• Automated glTF/FBX export for Unreal & Unity","x":-600,"y":-140,"width":480,"height":320,"color":"4"},
