		{"id":"android_blueprint","type":"text","text":"# 🏛️ Senior Android Blueprint\n**[[Senior Android Engineer Agent Blueprint]]**\n\n• Clean Architecture + MVI + Unidirectional Data Flow\n• Single Immutable UI State + Sealed Events\n• Type-safe Navigation 3 with @Serializable\n• Offline-first Room DB + Ktor network","x":1160,"y":-140,"width":480,"height":320,"color":"5"},
